- Reset requests run `npm run demo:reset` first; `reset-demo-state` only completes the script's reported MCP/discovery leftovers. One reset covers every track — do not add a 101-only or 201-only reset command. Whenever a demo beat creates a new leftover, update its session event record and `scripts/demo-reset.ts` in the same change.
- Never reintroduce retired pre-remap company or product names anywhere in this tree.

## Voice

Calm, specific, short. Prefer "invoice" and "credit" over "synergy." UI copy should sound like Fieldnote, not "Welcome to your app."
